    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχερωΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ΐδος, ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>white poplar, Populus
			alba,</i> elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.389
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1476
			</span></i>. (Expld. with ref. to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχέρων,</span> from the legend that it had been brought from
			the nether world by Hercules, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				5.14.2
			</span></i>.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχερωΐδες ὄχθαι</span>
			<i>of</i> the river <u>Acheron</u> in Asia Minor, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				13
			</span></i>.</div>
